But I am still curious whether it is related to the code logic of the program or general rule of SEM. Because as you see in the following link. I have seen some model suggestions for second order models with only 2 variables.  http://www.business.otago.ac.nz/mgmt/ANZAM2004/CD/Papers/ABSTRACT512.htm

